{"2399710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Trash Bunny House", "steam_appid": 2399710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "Trash Bunny House is a first-person exploration horror action game. You work as a writer on the edge working at a publishing company and you are heading towards an abandoned factory deep within the mountains. The abandoned factory was an old manufacturing site for animatronics meant for an amusement park. However, during manufacturing many unexplained fatal incidents occurred and it closed down. Then, after it was supposed to have been shut down, a tip-off came from someone who reported witnessing the animatronics often inside the factory. Take as many photos for the scoop as you can and come back alive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don't miss any chances with your shutter:</h2>When you point your camera at something that could be a scoop, you will get a notification of the chance to use your shutter. Because there may be danger the second you point your camera at something and it will be a precious moment you will not get again to take a photo, when the chance notification icon comes up, release the shutter immediately.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399710/extras/d022e1d5f5def192e6215897959600ec.poster.avif?t=1737447902\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399710/extras/d022e1d5f5def192e6215897959600ec.webm?t=1737447902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2399710/extras/d022e1d5f5def192e6215897959600ec.mp4?t=1737447902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play time:</h2>1-2 hours.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Autosave system:</h2>It will autosave at set points.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multi-ending system:</h2>If you are 